      "created_at": "2012-07-08T14:22:50.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yes, you play it on a hero, even if the hero was not damaged in the attack. pwatson1974’s explanation as to why is sound; you can also think of it as an effect of the infected person getting cut and their blood spreading the disease to others it lands on, or simply that the virus is now airborne!</p>",
